{"1892100":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"HEART ABYSS","steam_appid":1892100,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/94f42adc99c79ace762cbbdd73ff8181.avif?t=1793775458\" width=616 height=65 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/0a842e8542b05dc3552be6b031dd41e7.poster.avif?t=1793775458\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/0a842e8542b05dc3552be6b031dd41e7.webm?t=1793775458\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/0a842e8542b05dc3552be6b031dd41e7.mp4?t=1793775458\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a half-human, half-fox, the legendary Jinko, whose ancestors once saved the human Empire from an invasion of Yokai demons. Your name is Leon, and all you remember are the walls of the cage you were imprisoned in by humans.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But now, the collar is destroyed.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/7603c45b86fc1383139a536b17d97aa0.avif?t=1793775458\" width=616 height=65 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/faac5c44bec777e18121b2a4c81d1dc1.poster.avif?t=1793775458\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/faac5c44bec777e18121b2a4c81d1dc1.webm?t=1793775458\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/faac5c44bec777e18121b2a4c81d1dc1.mp4?t=1793775458\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Heart Abyss combat system is sharp and bloodthirsty, just like its main character. He needs to be in the thick of battle at all times to rip health from enemies and replenish energy for magical abilities. The KEY is not to stand still!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/300bbecb462f8fbf507757f883c26a07.poster.avif?t=1793775458\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/300bbecb462f8fbf507757f883c26a07.webm?t=1793775458\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/300bbecb462f8fbf507757f883c26a07.mp4?t=1793775458\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to his heritage, Leon possesses an impressive reserve of Qi energy. Rain lightning down on your enemies' heads, shoot them with deadly energy, and... who said foxes can't create a small singularity?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/e54418920cf5f2d5e512586d1305bd61.avif?t=1793775458\" width=616 height=65 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/94ca83bdfa9b2a4478d7be18c1acf595.poster.avif?t=1793775458\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/94ca83bdfa9b2a4478d7be18c1acf595.webm?t=1793775458\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/94ca83bdfa9b2a4478d7be18c1acf595.mp4?t=1793775458\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit various corners of the Empire – from the majestic Capital to the Temple of Death, lost amidst snowy mountains. Meet interesting people and mythical creatures from Japanese folklore. Tear them to shreds (if they are warriors of the Empire).<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Leon, immerse yourself in the aesthetics of Japanese folklore, ancient temples, and Yokai demons. Here, bloody katana battles coexist with delicious ramen, torii gates, and blooming sakura.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/9e05cc9e1eb5f2178a770f8b36f11216.poster.avif?t=1793775458\" width=780 height=396 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/9e05cc9e1eb5f2178a770f8b36f11216.webm?t=1793775458\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/9e05cc9e1eb5f2178a770f8b36f11216.mp4?t=1793775458\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hundred years have passed since the invasion of the Yokai demons. The Human Empire oppresses all other magical beings, and the legendary Jinko have not been seen for many years.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leon must uncover the reason for his people's disappearance and, perhaps, save the Empire once again. Or, conversely, plunge it into the abyss of chaos.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/cd59b29c252582b8fa808b96bb3e4710.poster.avif?t=1793775458\" width=780 height=462 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/cd59b29c252582b8fa808b96bb3e4710.webm?t=1793775458\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/cd59b29c252582b8fa808b96bb3e4710.mp4?t=1793775458\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/94f42adc99c79ace762cbbdd73ff8181.avif?t=1793775458\" width=616 height=65 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/0a842e8542b05dc3552be6b031dd41e7.poster.avif?t=1793775458\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/0a842e8542b05dc3552be6b031dd41e7.webm?t=1793775458\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/0a842e8542b05dc3552be6b031dd41e7.mp4?t=1793775458\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a half-human, half-fox, the legendary Jinko, whose ancestors once saved the human Empire from an invasion of Yokai demons. Your name is Leon, and all you remember are the walls of the cage you were imprisoned in by humans.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But now, the collar is destroyed.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/7603c45b86fc1383139a536b17d97aa0.avif?t=1793775458\" width=616 height=65 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/faac5c44bec777e18121b2a4c81d1dc1.poster.avif?t=1793775458\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/faac5c44bec777e18121b2a4c81d1dc1.webm?t=1793775458\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/faac5c44bec777e18121b2a4c81d1dc1.mp4?t=1793775458\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Heart Abyss combat system is sharp and bloodthirsty, just like its main character. He needs to be in the thick of battle at all times to rip health from enemies and replenish energy for magical abilities. The KEY is not to stand still!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/300bbecb462f8fbf507757f883c26a07.poster.avif?t=1793775458\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/300bbecb462f8fbf507757f883c26a07.webm?t=1793775458\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/300bbecb462f8fbf507757f883c26a07.mp4?t=1793775458\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to his heritage, Leon possesses an impressive reserve of Qi energy. Rain lightning down on your enemies' heads, shoot them with deadly energy, and... who said foxes can't create a small singularity?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/e54418920cf5f2d5e512586d1305bd61.avif?t=1793775458\" width=616 height=65 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/94ca83bdfa9b2a4478d7be18c1acf595.poster.avif?t=1793775458\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/94ca83bdfa9b2a4478d7be18c1acf595.webm?t=1793775458\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/94ca83bdfa9b2a4478d7be18c1acf595.mp4?t=1793775458\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit various corners of the Empire – from the majestic Capital to the Temple of Death, lost amidst snowy mountains. Meet interesting people and mythical creatures from Japanese folklore. Tear them to shreds (if they are warriors of the Empire).<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Leon, immerse yourself in the aesthetics of Japanese folklore, ancient temples, and Yokai demons. Here, bloody katana battles coexist with delicious ramen, torii gates, and blooming sakura.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/9e05cc9e1eb5f2178a770f8b36f11216.poster.avif?t=1793775458\" width=780 height=396 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/9e05cc9e1eb5f2178a770f8b36f11216.webm?t=1793775458\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/9e05cc9e1eb5f2178a770f8b36f11216.mp4?t=1793775458\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hundred years have passed since the invasion of the Yokai demons. The Human Empire oppresses all other magical beings, and the legendary Jinko have not been seen for many years.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leon must uncover the reason for his people's disappearance and, perhaps, save the Empire once again. Or, conversely, plunge it into the abyss of chaos.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/cd59b29c252582b8fa808b96bb3e4710.poster.avif?t=1793775458\" width=780 height=462 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/cd59b29c252582b8fa808b96bb3e4710.webm?t=1793775458\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/extras\/cd59b29c252582b8fa808b96bb3e4710.mp4?t=1793775458\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"Heart Abyss is a brutal action-platformer inspired by Japan during the 17th and 18th centuries. Wake up your inner beast and take vengeance on those who put a collar around your neck. Find your sister and uncover the mystery behind the disappearance of all jinkos.","supported_languages":"English, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Italian, Portuguese - Portugal","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/b1f8dbae637a69b8950f8a2a1d7dbd006899ee46\/header_alt_assets_3.jpg?t=1793775458","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/d1d142c292f1d638122c91c77250d3607a52ae9b\/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_3.jpg?t=1793775458","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1892100\/d1d142c292f1d638122c91c77250d3607a52ae9b\/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_3.jpg?t=1793775458","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:<\/strong> Windows 7, 8, 8.1, 10 x64<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-3240 (2*3400) or equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 1 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> GeForce 7600 GT (512 MB)<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 200 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"legal_notice":"(c)